{"kind":"pr","url":"https://github.com/RoperaSn88/Echo-Edge/pull/146","repo":"RoperaSn88/Echo-Edge","number":146,"set":"agent","source":"copilot-agent","title":"スキル選択後のカメラ復帰を回転あり/なしで分離","body":"スキル選択解除時のカメラ復帰で、用途に応じて「回転あり」と「回転なし」を使い分けられるように修正しました。  \n0度へ戻す仕様は維持しつつ、装備品選択から戻る場合のみ回転演出を行います。\n\n- **変更点: カメラリセット処理の分離**\n  - `CameraManager` に以下を追加/整理\n    - `ActResetCameraTarget()`：回転なしでデフォルト角度へ復帰（`Y=0`）\n    - `ActResetCameraTargetWithRotate()`：回転ありでデフォルト角度へ復帰（`Y=360` 経由）\n  - 内部で共通処理を使い、回転有無のみを切り替える構成に変更\n\n- **呼び出し側の変更**\n  - `PlayerWeaponPhase`（装備品選択から戻る経路）を `ActResetCameraTargetWithRotate()` に変更\n  - それ以外の既存呼び出しは `ActResetCameraTarget()`（回転なし）のまま維持\n\n- **影響範囲**\n  - カメラリセット処理と装備品選択復帰フローのみ\n  - 他のズーム・位置・オフセット補間ロジックには非変更\n\n```csharp\n// 回転なし\nawait CameraManager.Instance.ActResetCameraTarget();\n\n// 装備品選択から戻るときのみ回転あり\nawait CameraManager.Instance.ActResetCameraTargetWithRotate();\n```","authorType":"Bot","additions":625,"deletions":84,"changedFiles":24,"files":[{"path":"Assets/AddressableAssetsData/ProfileDataSourceSettings.asset","additions":28,"deletions":0},{"path":"Assets/AddressableAssetsData/ProfileDataSourceSettings.asset.meta","additions":8,"deletions":0},{"path":"Assets/AddressableAssetsData/WebGL.meta","additions":8,"deletions":0},{"path":"Assets/AddressableAssetsData/Windows.meta","additions":8,"deletions":0},{"path":"Assets/Animation/Player/Player.controller","additions":266,"deletions":26},{"path":"Assets/Animation/Player/Skill1.anim","additions":72,"deletions":0},{"path":"Assets/Animation/Player/Skill1.anim.meta","additions":8,"deletions":0},{"path":"Assets/Animation/Player/Skill2.anim","additions":72,"deletions":0},{"path":"Assets/Animation/Player/Skill2.anim.meta","additions":8,"deletions":0},{"path":"Assets/Scenes/SampleScene/TitleVolume.asset","additions":3,"deletions":0},{"path":"Assets/Scripts/Battle/EnergyManager.cs","additions":7,"deletions":0},{"path":"Assets/Scripts/Camera/CameraManager.cs","additions":43,"deletions":15},{"path":"Assets/Scrip